    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 16,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Managed-resource coverage\nThe operator endpoint exports controller activity by resource type, but its internal `k8s_*` managed-resource counters use Tailscale client telemetry and are not registered as Prometheus metrics. Aggregate managed-resource readiness therefore comes from kube-state-metrics for StatefulSets labeled `tailscale.com/managed=true`. Proxy names, parent resource names, tailnet names, device names, API hosts, keys, and login URLs are not queried or displayed.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Telemetry Scope",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
